These files are the glTF-targeted decoder builds bundled with three.js
(three/examples/jsm/libs/draco/gltf/): draco_wasm_wrapper.js,
draco_decoder.wasm and the draco_decoder.js fallback. They are committed here
so local furniture import can decode KHR_draco_mesh_compression geometry
without fetching any external resource.
